# Ignore everything: the mx-sdk image is the pinned toolchain only and the
# Dockerfile has no COPY/ADD, so nothing from the build context enters the
# image. Source and build state reach the container at `docker run` time via
# the workspace bind-mount and the mx-build volume, not through the build
# context. Keeping the context empty makes `docker buildx build` transfer
# nothing regardless of what sits at the repo root (data/, gen/, build dirs).
*
